<title>UK: UK's Ronson says receives bid approach.</title>
<headline>UK's Ronson says receives bid approach.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>British consumer brands distributor Ronson Plc said on Thursday it had received an approach which may or may not lead to an offer being made for the company.</p>
<p>The company's share price was up 4 1/2 pence to 23p after the announcement.</p>
<p>The company said in June it expected to report a loss of about two million stg for 1996, roughly double the figure it previously estimated.</p>
<p>The company attributed the revised estimate to additional bad debt provisions.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
</text>
